Dear NovaTech Team,

Open Enrollment for 2026 benefits runs March 10–31, 2026. Changes made during this window take effect April 1, 2026.

WHAT YOU NEED TO DO
-------------------
1. Log in to WorkDay > Benefits > Open Enrollment.
2. Review medical, dental, vision, and voluntary plans.
3. Confirm or update HSA/FSA elections and beneficiaries.
4. Click "Submit" — incomplete elections default to current plan (where allowed).

KEY DATES
---------
- March 10: Enrollment opens
- March 31, 11:59 PM PT: Enrollment closes (no extensions)
- April 1: New elections effective

HIGHLIGHTS FOR 2026
-------------------
- New mental health EAP sessions: 12 free visits per year (up from 8)
- Remote work stipend remains $500/year for eligible hybrid employees (see Remote Work Policy HR-RWP-2026-003)
- Added pet insurance option via VPI

QUESTIONS?
Contact Benefits at benefits@novatech.io or join office hours Tue/Thu 12–1 PM CT on Zoom (link in WorkDay).

Thank you,
NovaTech People Operations
